> powers of unique monsters are only halved by resistance. Purple
> worms do massive acid digestive damage. TOUGHVLAD (minus
> stoning ;). Etc.

The main problem with this idea is that it makes conduct ascensions (like
illiterate) much harder, without really changing vanilla ascensions.

Making the guys below the castle nastier just encourages you to buff up a
little more -- find 2 or 3 more scrolls of enchant armor, sac-and-pray for
a few more points of AC, alchemize a few more potions for HP -- before you
face them.

Overall, most of these YANIs seem to be imposing extra difficulty on the
normal game (that really just translates into "more pre-castle prep time")
and making certain conducts much more difficult.  None of them seem to add
a significant challenge to the late game.



